\ Exercises the well-known partial-dispatch marker under runtime-image AOT.
\ The freshly-pushed marker must compare equal to the one serialized onto
\ `case`'s word definition: the image loader resolves the serialized marker
\ through lookupWellKnownMarker back to the static singleton, preserving
\ freeze->runtime pointer identity.

partial-dispatch partial-dispatch = .
"case" word-markers [ partial-dispatch = ] #filter #count 0 > .
